01:13:00,942 --> 01:13:09,696
那么从我到目标的启发式值不应超过我的后继节点（即我可以前往的下一个地方）的启发式值，再加上
the heuristic value from me to the goal shouldn't be more than the heuristic value of my successor, the next place I could go to, plus however

830
01:13:10,016 --> 01:13:14,084
从当前步骤跨越到下一个步骤所需的成本。
much it would cost me to just make that step from one step to the next step.

831
01:13:14,574 --> 01:13:19,780
所以这只是在确保我的启发式函数在我可能采取的所有步骤中都是一致的。
And so this is just making sure that my heuristic is consistent between all of these steps that I might take.

832
01:13:20,142 --> 01:13:25,216
只要这一点成立，A* 搜索就能为我找到最优解。
So as long as this is true, then A star search is going to find me an optimal solution.

833
01:13:25,582 --> 01:13:29,696
而这正是解决这些搜索问题时有时会遇到的挑战所在。
And this is where much of the challenge of solving these search problems can sometimes come in.

834
01:13:29,934 --> 01:13:37,136
虽然 A* 是一个已知算法，你可以相对容易地编写代码，但选择合适的启发式函数可能是一个很有趣的挑战。
That A star search is an algorithm that is known and you could write the code fairly easily, but it's choosing the heuristic that can be the interesting challenge.

835
01:13:37,390 --> 01:13:42,692
启发式函数越好，我就能在探索更少状态的情况下更好地解决问题。
The better the heuristic is, the better I'll be able to solve the problem in the fewer states that I'll have to explore.

836
01:13:42,958 --> 01:13:47,652
而且我必须确保启发式函数满足这些特定的约束条件。
And I need to make sure that the heuristic satisfies these particular constraints.

837
01:13:48,654 --> 01:13:54,756
