比如像 tic-tac-toe 这样的游戏，我们有一个 3x3 的网格，X 和 O 交替行动，在这些方格中的任何一个位置写下 X 或 O，
A game like tic-tac-toe, where we've got this three by three grid, and X and O take turns, either writing an X or an O in any one of these squares,

849
01:14:56,238 --> 01:15:01,924
如果你是 X 玩家，目标就是连成三个 X；如果你是 O 玩家，目标就是连成三个 O。
and the goal is to get three X's in a row if you're the X player, or three O's in a row if you're the O player.

