01:17:43,406 --> 01:17:44,836
给这些所有可能的情况中的每一个。
to each one of those possible ways.

879
01:17:45,166 --> 01:17:49,380
在井字棋以及许多其他类型的游戏中，都有三种可能的结果。
And in a tic-tac-toe game, and in many types of games, there are three possible outcomes.

880
01:17:49,902 --> 01:17:54,020
结果是 O 赢、X 赢，或者没人赢。
The outcomes are O wins, X wins, or nobody wins.

