我们规定 O 赢的价值为负一。
We'll say O winning, that'll have a value of negative one.

884
01:18:07,342 --> 01:18:09,284
没人赢的价值为零。
Nobody winning, that'll have a value of zero.

885
01:18:09,710 --> 01:18:12,304
而 X 赢的价值为一。
And X winning, that will have a value of one.

886
01:18:13,006 --> 01:18:16,420
所以我们刚刚给这三种可能的结果中的每一个都分配了数字。
So we've just assigned numbers to each of these three possible outcomes.

887
01:18:16,942 --> 01:18:19,236
现在我们有两个玩家。
And now we have two players.

888
01:18:19,470 --> 01:18:21,668
一个是 X 玩家，一个是 O 玩家。
We have the X player and the O player.

889
01:18:22,254 --> 01:18:28,612
我们将 X 玩家称为最大化玩家，并将 O 玩家称为最小化玩家。
And we're going to go ahead and call the X player the max player. And we'll call the O player the min player.

890
01:18:29,102 --> 01:18:37,024
之所以这样称呼，是因为在 Minimax 算法中，最大化玩家（在这种情况下是 X）的目标是最大化分数。
And the reason why is because in the Minimax algorithm, the max player, which in this case is X, is aiming to maximize the score.

891
01:18:37,350 --> 01:18:42,564
对吧？这些是可能的分数：负一、零和一，X 希望最大化分数。
right? These are the possible options for the score: negative one, zero, and one, X wants to maximize the score.

892
01:18:42,926 --> 01:18:49,060
这意味着，如果可能的话，X 更希望处于这种情况，即 X 赢了比赛并获得 1 分。
Meaning, if at all possible, X would like this situation, where X wins the game and we give it a score of one.

893
01:18:49,742 --> 01:18:57,700
但如果这不可行，如果 X 必须在这两个选项中做出选择：负一（意味着 O 赢）或者零（意味着没人赢）
But if this isn't possible, if X needs to choose between these two options, negative one meaning O winning, or zero meaning nobody winning,

894
01:18:58,064 --> 01:19:03,424
X 更愿意让没人赢，得分是零，而不是得分为负一的 O 赢。
X would rather that nobody wins, score of zero, than a score of negative one, O

