winning. So this notion of winning and losing and tying has been reduced mathematically to just this idea of try and maximize the score.

896
01:19:12,224 --> 01:19:20,624
X 玩家总是希望得分更高，而另一方面，最小化玩家（在这种情况下是 O）的目标是最小化分数。
The X player always wants the score to be bigger, and on the flip side, the min player, in this case O, is aiming to minimize the score.

897
01:19:20,718 --> 01:19:24,484
O 玩家希望分数尽可能小。
The O player wants the score to be as small as possible.

898
01:19:25,422 --> 01:19:30,624
所以现在我们把这个井字棋游戏、赢和输，转化成了数学问题。
So now we've taken this game of X's and O's and winning and losing and turned it into something mathematical.

899
01:19:30,784 --> 01:19:35,108
变成了一个 X 试图最大化分数，而 O 试图最小化分数的模型。
Something where X is trying to maximize the score, O is trying to minimize the score.

