我们需要某种初始状态，在此时我们称之为 S0，即游戏的开始状态，比如一个空白的 tic-tac-toe 棋盘。
We'll need some sort of initial state that we'll in this case call S0, which is how the game begins, like an empty tic-tac-toe board, for example.

