在经典的 tic-tac-toe 游戏中，终止状态意味着有人连成三子，或者棋盘上的所有格子都填满了。
In a classic game of tic-tac-toe, a terminal state means either someone has gotten three in a row, or all of the squares of the tic-tac-toe board are filled.

914
01:20:50,144 --> 01:20:52,580
这两个条件中的任何一个都会使其成为终止状态。
Either of those conditions make it a terminal state.

915
01:20:52,878 --> 01:20:59,492
在国际象棋中，这可能是指出现将死，或者如果不再可能达成将死，那么这种情况就变成终止状态。
In a game of chess, it might be something like when there is checkmate, or if checkmate is no longer possible, that that becomes a terminal state.

916
