01:21:10,638 --> 01:21:12,784
如果 O 赢了比赛，它的值就是 -1。
If O has won the game, that has a value of negative one.

919
01:21:13,166 --> 01:21:15,584
如果没人赢，它的值就是
If nobody has won the game, that has a value of

