这对 Minimax 算法来说是个大问题，因为 Minimax 从初始状态开始，考虑所有可能的动作，以及之后的每一个可能动作，
And this is a pretty big problem for the Minimax algorithm, because the Minimax algorithm starts with an initial state, considers all the possible actions, and all the possible actions after that,

