要么没下雨，要么就在下雨，在这种情况下哈里就在室内。
Either it's not raining, or it is raining, in which case Harry is inside.

2035
03:01:14,830 --> 03:01:17,604
所以我能得出的结论是：要么没下雨，
So the conclusion I can draw is either it is not raining,

2036
