许多这类推理规则都是将使用特定符号的逻辑转换为不同符号的逻辑，比如把蕴含变成 OR，
So many of these inference rules are taking logic that uses certain symbols and turning them into different symbols, taking an implication and turning it into an OR,

2056
03:03:05,200 --> 03:03:08,260
或者把双条件转换成蕴含。
or taking a biconditional and turning it into implication.

