所以我们在这里做的只是把“1除以降雨概率”这个值当作一个常数，最后我们可以选择用它来除，或者等同地乘以它的倒数。
So all we've done here is said this value of one over the probability of rain, that's really just a constant that we're going to divide by or equivalently multiply by the inverse of at the end.

