04:18:43,854 --> 04:18:47,472
但当然，0.08 和 0.02 加起来并不等于 1。
But of course, 0.08 and 0.02 don't sum up to the number one.

2806
04:18:47,854 --> 04:18:54,912
我们知道在概率分布中，如果你考虑所有可能的值，它们必须加起来等于 1。
And we know that in a probability distribution, if you consider all of the possible values, they must sum up to a probability of one.

2807
