也就是说，a 是一个具有一定概率的事件，我想知道 a 不发生的概率是多少。
So a is an event that has some probability, and I would like to know what is the probability that a does not occur.

2821
04:20:25,422 --> 04:20:34,564
结果发现它就是 1 减去 P(A)，这很合理，因为如果这是两种可能的情况，要么 A 发生，要么 A 不发生，
And it turns out it's just one minus p of a, which makes sense, because if those are the two possible cases, either A happens or A doesn't happen,

2822
04:20:34,894 --> 04:20:38,340
那么当你把这两种情况相加时，必然等于 1，这意味着
then when you add up those two cases, you must get one, which means

2823
04:20:38,990 --> 04:20:39,712
P(非A)。
P of not A.

2824
04:20:40,432 --> 04:20:46,352
必须就是 1 减去 P(A)，因为 P(A) 和 P(非A) 的和必须等于 1。
Must just be one minus P of A, because P of A and P of not A must sum up to the number one.

2825
04:20:46,592 --> 04:20:48,324
它们必须涵盖所有可能的情况。
