5199
08:09:59,790 --> 08:10:06,212
但在这个特定情况下，损失，也就是经验损失，并不是零，因为我们并没有完美地对所有情况进行分类。
But the loss, the empirical loss, isn't zero in this particular case, because we didn't categorize everything perfectly.

5200
08:10:06,958 --> 08:10:13,220
这里有一个离群值，就是这一天虽然没下雨，但我们的模型仍然预测为下雨。
There was this one outlier, this one day that it wasn't raining, but yet our model still predicts that it is raining.

5201
08:10:13,518 --> 08:10:17,828
但这并不一定意味着我们的模型很差，只意味着模型的准确率不是 100%。
But that doesn't necessarily mean our model is bad, it just means the model isn't 100% accurate.

5202
08:10:18,702 --> 08:10:26,464
如果你真的想找出一个能最小化损失的假设，你可以设计一个不同的决策边界。
If you really wanted to try and find a hypothesis that resulted in minimizing the loss, you could come up with a different decision boundary.

5203
08:10:26,544 --> 08:10:29,028
它不是一条线，但看起来会像这样。
